WEBVTT

00:05:29.651 --> 00:05:32.521
record their voice, and then their doctor can check up

00:05:32.521 --> 00:05:35.202
on their progress, see where they're doing in this course of the disease.

00:05:35.202 --> 00:05:36.172
ML: Absolutely.

00:05:36.172 --> 00:05:37.915
TR: Thanks so much. Max Little, everybody.

00:05:37.915 --> 00:05:43.072
ML: Thanks, Tom. (Applause)